# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything in this project is committed EXCEPT the raw AIS downloads, which
# GitHub cannot take: its hard limit is 100 MB per file and these are 836 MB,
# 304 MB, 124 MB and 103 MB. They are unmodified public-domain US federal data
# from https://marinecadastre.gov/ais/ (date 2023-01-01). Re-download and run
# PIPELINE.py to regenerate everything downstream; the built datasets are
# committed, so no experiment here needs the raw file.
#
# Intermediates (windows_*.csv), superseded datasets (old8_*.csv), run logs and
# saved kernel matrices ARE committed. They are the experimental record.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
